    "description": "[WePlay - Fun Party Games]\r\nWePlay is a Party Game app that young people love to play. It offers the most popular casual party games and voice interaction. You will have more fun while playing games!\r\n\r\n[Online Party Game Bar]\r\nSpace Werewolf: The most popular social deduction game where civilians pit their wits against killers\r\nMic Grab: New mode for Mic Grab, more hot songs, more fun! If you love singing, then you should not miss it!\r\nWho's the Spy: A classic game in variety shows. Come and battle against your friends!\r\nGuess My Drawing: it not only tests your creativity but also teamwork and drawing skills!\r\n\r\n[New Interactive Features]\r\n3D Avatar & Cloth Changing: Create a 3D avatar , face pinching, model clothes, show your self-avatar!\r\n\r\nPlay games, sing, and have fun with new friends in WePlay!\r\nIn WePlay, there are always humorous and friendly people waiting for you.",
